	(text_box "TODO:\n1. Investigate settings on the DAC & ADC to verify they align with the schematic.\n2. Is there a backend? Verify with team. \n3. Is Pico model compatible with Pico2? \n4. Check with team about power system.\n5. VERIFY ALL COMPONENTS USED ARE CORRECT BEFORE ORDERING"
